      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/protomyzon_pachychilus_season_for_panda_loaches__en/",
      "html": "<p>The extremely charming juveniles of the Panda loach are available only a few weeks per year. Fully grown Panda loaches lose the juvenile pattern and get a brownish and greyish coloration. The species attains a length of 6-7 cm.</p><p>The Panda loach has been placed currently in the new genus Yaoshania, so the full scientific name is now Yaoshania pachychilus.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/protomyzon_pachychilus_season_for_panda_loaches__en/",
      "html": "<p>This year the fish bred very successfully, so a comparatively large number of specimens is offered at comparatively low prices. Among the specimens imported this year were, for the first time, many aberrantly coloured fish. Most look as one is used to for the youngsters of this species: black and white rings and a black nose.</p>"
    }
